<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{ doc.numero }} · Manifiesto de Carga</title>
<style>
  {{ fontStyle | raw }}
  @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 12mm 10mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root { --ink: #161411; --ink-2: #57524b; --ink-3: #8c857c; --paper: #fbfaf6; --rule: #161411; --line: #e6e2d9; --accent: #2f5a4a; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }
  .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  p { margin: 0; }

  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 9px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); margin-bottom: 11px; }
  .hero, .foot { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .hero .co { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
  .hero .co .logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; flex: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }
  .hero .co .logo svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--accent); }
  .hero .co .logo img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  .hero .co .co-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .hero .co .co-name { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 500; }
  .hero .co .co-sub { font-size: 9px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 2px; }
  .hero .co .co-meta { font-size: 8.5px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 3px; max-width: 560px; display: block; }
  .hero .co .co-meta .manifest-header-location { margin-top: 2px; }
  .hero .co .co-meta b { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .hero .mid { text-align: right; }
  .hero .mid .doc-kind { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; }
  .hero .mid .doc-sub { font-size: 8px; color: var(--ink-3); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; }
  .hero .mid .doc-num { margin-top: 2px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hero .mid .meta2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto auto; gap: 1px 10px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.2; justify-content: end; }
  .hero .mid .meta2 .k { font-size: 7.5px; color: var(--ink-3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-align: left; }
  .hero .mid .meta2 .v { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 500; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }

  .section-title { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
  .section-title .c { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-size: 8.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--ink-3); }

  .items { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; }
  .items thead { display: table-header-group; }
  .items tfoot { display: table-row-group; }
  .items tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .items thead th { font-size: 7.5px; line-height: 1.2; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 500; text-align: left; padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .items tbody td { padding: 3px 6px 3px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; font-size: 8.5px; line-height: 1.15; }
  .items .c-index { width: 22px; text-align: center; }
  .items .c-fecha { width: 65px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .items .c-serie { width: 93px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .items .c-taquito { width: 65px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .items .c-destinatario { width: 215px; }
  .items .c-mercancia { width: 129px; }
  .items .c-flete { width: 65px; text-align: right; }
  .items .c-pago { width: 65px; padding-right: 0; text-align: center; }
  .items .party { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 500; }
  .items .recipient-text { display: block; width: 100%; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .items .merchandise { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 500; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; }
  .items .merch-item { display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; }
  .items .pago .t { font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .items .pago .t.cancelado { color: var(--accent); }
  .items .pago .t.cobrar, .items .pago .t.pce { color: var(--ink-3); }
  .items tfoot td { padding: 6px 6px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-weight: 600; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .items tfoot .lbl { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: 10px; }
  .items tfoot td { padding-right: 0; }
  .items tfoot .totals { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 15px; }
  .items tfoot .total-k { color: var(--ink-3); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 7.5px; margin-right: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .foot { margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .foot .note { font-size: 9px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .foot .note strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .foot .note .badge { display: inline-block; color: var(--accent); padding: 3px 0; font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent); margin-bottom: 7px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="co">
    <div class="logo manifest-logo">{% if params.logo is not empty %}<img src="{{ params.logo }}" alt="logo"/>{% else %}<svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14"/><path d="M9 23l5-9 6 4 6-7"/></svg>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="co-copy">
      <div class="co-name">{{ doc.emisorRazonSocial }}</div>
      {% if doc.emisorNombreComercial is not empty and doc.emisorNombreComercial != doc.emisorRazonSocial %}<div class="co-sub">{{ doc.emisorNombreComercial }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="co-meta">
        {% if doc.emisorDireccion is not empty %}<div class="manifest-header-address">{{ doc.emisorDireccion }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if doc.emisorUbicacion is not empty %}<div class="manifest-header-location">{{ doc.emisorUbicacion }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mid">
    <div class="doc-kind">Manifiesto de Carga</div>
    <div class="doc-sub">Documento interno</div>
    <div class="doc-num">{{ doc.numero }}</div>
    <div class="meta2">
      <span class="k">Placa</span><span class="v">{{ doc.placa }}</span>
      <span class="k">Marca</span><span class="v">{{ doc.marca }}</span>
      <span class="k">Fecha de salida</span><span class="v">{% if doc.fechaSalida is not null %}{{ doc.fechaSalida|date('d/m/Y') }}{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-title"><span>Carga consolidada — guías de remisión</span></div>
<table class="items">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th class="c-index">#</th>
      <th class="c-fecha">F. Emisión</th>
      <th class="c-serie">Serie · N°</th>
      <th class="c-taquito">N° Tracking</th>
      <th class="c-destinatario">Destinatario</th>
      <th class="c-mercancia">Mercancía</th>
      <th class="c-flete">Flete S/</th>
      <th class="c-pago">Pago</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for l in doc.lineas %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-index mono">{{ l.numeroOrden }}</td>
      <td class="c-fecha mono">{% if l.fechaEmision is not null %}{{ l.fechaEmision|date('d/m/Y') }}{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="c-serie mono">{{ l.guiaSerieNumero }}</td>
      <td class="c-taquito mono">{{ l.taquito }}</td>
      <td class="party c-destinatario"><span class="recipient-text">{{ l.destinatario }}</span></td>
      <td class="merchandise c-mercancia">{% for item in l.mercancia|split(' · ') %}<span class="merch-item">{{ item }}{% if not loop.last %} ·{% endif %}</span>{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
      <td class="c-flete mono">{{ l.flete|n_format }}</td>
      <td class="pago c-pago">{% if l.condicionPago is not empty %}<span class="t {{ l.pagoClase }}">{{ l.condicionPago }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
  <tfoot>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="8">
        <div class="totals">
          <span class="lbl">Total · {{ doc.totalGuias }} guías consolidadas</span>
          <span><span class="total-k">Bultos</span><span class="mono">{{ doc.totalBultos }}</span></span>
          <span><span class="total-k">Flete</span><span class="mono">{{ doc.totalFlete|n_format }}</span></span>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tfoot>
</table>

<div class="foot">
  <div class="note">
    <span class="badge">Uso interno</span>
    <p>Documento de <strong>control de carga consolidada</strong> para el viaje. No constituye comprobante de pago ni guía de remisión electrónica; cada guía se sustenta de forma individual.</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
